      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......好熱......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好痛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這女人，還不肯說嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好渴......喉嚨像是被火烤著......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......究竟有多長時間了......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_009",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真厲害啊，都被吊在這一天多了，真虧她能忍得住啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗暴的賞金獵人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_009",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂，你們可別把她搞死了，寶藏的位置她還沒說呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我不會.....不會告訴你的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_009",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別給她水喝，直到她說了為止！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我會死......嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒想到就算到了卡西米爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "胡作非為的歹徒也是哪裡都有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？哪裡來的傢伙，不想活了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗暴的賞金獵人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂，小子，你趕緊給我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗暴的賞金獵人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔，好，好疼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗暴的賞金獵人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "仔細看，他這身裝扮......不像是當地人啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "管他是哪裡來的！他就一個人，不過是來送死的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "所以，得把你們全部解決掉才行？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗暴的賞金獵人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "噗啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咕......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#3",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "好了，他們一時半會還醒不過來，我們趕緊離開這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你......你是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#3",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "別怕，沒有人能再傷害你了，我會帶你離開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉，我、我的頭......好暈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#3",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "你臉色不太好。沒關係，讓我抱著你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#3",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "請抓緊了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯....."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "晴 \\ 能見度 14公里\n某村莊內"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你有沒有看到一個拿長槍的小子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_005",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我一直待在家裡，外面發生什麼我不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要是讓我知道你窩藏了他們，有你好看的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_005",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "————"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_005",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那群傢伙已經離開了，格拉尼騎警小姐，你們可以從壁櫥裡出來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#3",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "嘿~！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#3",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "又被大叔幫了大忙啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_005",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可蘿爾你沒事吧？真是苦了你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "盧克大叔，多謝你，我現在好多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#3",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "因為有大家的幫助，我才能救出你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_005",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可蘿爾，不要擔心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_005",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "騎士小姐已經和我們商量好了！她一定會拯救整個村子的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊？小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#2",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "這，是啊，我是女孩子啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#1",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "唔！就算是我，也是有女孩子的自尊心的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸、欸，對不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雖然看穿著不像......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "請問，您是......新受封的卡西米爾騎士大人嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在您解救我們村子之後，會向我們徵稅嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#3",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "不不不，我可並不是卡西米爾人，更不是什麼騎士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#3",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "雖然維多利亞也有騎士，但我之前是騎警啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#3",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "騎警和騎士不一樣，是公務治安職務。騎警做事，不圖回報，可不會向你們徵什麼稅！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "維多利亞？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#3",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "是在卡西米爾外面的地方，我的祖輩也都是從卡西米爾遷到那裡去的庫蘭塔人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#3",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "這次接到了你們的委託，也是想來卡西米爾看一看，父母的家鄉是什麼樣......沒想到會是這麼嚴重的事態。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我本來以為，交給信使的那些委託信都石沉大海了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "畢竟那些民間互助組織從來不會在意我們這偏僻的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#4",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "不過，為什麼卡西米爾政府沒有伸出援手？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哼......首都的騎士大人們怎麼會關注我們這種偏遠的村子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "正因如此，許多年來，我們反而過得很安穩，城市裡動盪不安的生活也不怎麼吸引我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "滴水村的人們世世代代都在這片山區附近居住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "儘管生活沒那麼富裕，但至少我們可以自給自足。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雖然有時候會為了躲避天災暫時遷走村莊，但這裡畢竟還是我們的家園。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以，我們無法割捨這片土地......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "但是現在，村子卻被那些賞金獵人破壞得滿目瘡痍——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......都是因為那個騎士寶藏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "最近幾年，附近的幾個村落都成了賞金獵人們常常光顧的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好像是，卡西米爾北部控制區常有動亂什麼的，所以不斷有賞金獵人去那裡尋找發財的機會，而我們滴水村位於通往北方的必經之路上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "本來村子就經常會有賞金獵人出入，但是也沒有造成什麼危害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "直到一個月前，有一夥賞金獵人在山中挖出了一位隨從騎士的石棺，還翻出了一小箱陪葬的金幣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#3",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "是這種印著卡西米爾徽章的金幣吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#3",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "我剛來這裡就有賞金獵人跑來找麻煩，這幾枚金幣，算做他們舉止粗魯的賠禮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......就是這些金幣，在賞金獵人之間帶出了一段傳說，也給我們帶來了大麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“卡西米爾的每位古代騎士會帶著他們的精神與財富，下葬於其家鄉的無名之地，並永世保護著這片土地。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“只有來自不懼犧牲，無畏艱險的卡西米爾血脈才能破除所有的阻礙。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這樣的傳說被傳得越來越遠，附近的賞金獵人變得越來越多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "最初，賞金獵人還只是討論如何尋找更大的騎士寶藏，可後來“滴水村有人知道騎士寶藏下落”的消息卻不知怎麼的越傳越開——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "————噓！大家先別說話！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不行，找不到他們，給我從頭再搜一遍！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "繼續待在這裡不太安全，不能拖累這位大叔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "總之，我們先離開這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_005",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們要小心點自己的安全，騎士......不對，騎警小姐，村長就交給你了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#2",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "大叔，你放心，我一定保護好——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#1",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "啊？村長？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......滴水村村長可蘿爾，雖然上任才半年，就算是我，也是有村長的自尊心的哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
